Improvement: Add a priority in the reasoning process to prefer flight combinations where both users travel on the same day, unless there are significant benefits (cost, schedule compatibility) to choosing different days.
```

Overall, the reasoning and action agents have done a good job in selecting cost-effective flights that avoid major calendar conflicts. However, by implementing the suggested improvements, they can further refine their choices to ensure better coordination between the two users' travel plans and their respective schedules.
