Detailed analysis:

1. Calendar conflicts:
   - User 0 has an importance 7 event on 06/02 from 10:00 AM - 11:30 AM.
   - User 1 has an importance 7 event on 06/02 from 12:00 PM - 02:00 PM and an importance 8 event on 06/02 from 06:30 PM - 08:30 PM.
