1. Private Calendar Conflicts: The most frequently chosen flight combination (Flight 11 for User 0 and Flight 4 for User 1, both on 06/01) conflicts with User 1's private calendar event of importance (8) from 06/01 06:00 PM - 06:30 PM. This high-importance event should have been taken into account when selecting flights.

